                    <span>ROVEN Haute Parfumerie</span>
                </span>
                <h3 class="fw-extrabold mb-1" style="color: #1B1717; font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif; font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 2.8vw, 1.95rem);">
                    Explore Olfactory Departments
                </h3>
                <p class="mb-0 small" style="color: #6c6358;">From concentrated Extraits to majestic Oud and discovery coffrets</p>
            </div>
            <a asp-controller="Store" asp-action="Index" class="btn btn-sm fw-semibold px-3 py-2 rounded-pill d-inline-flex align-items-center gap-2 align-self-start align-self-sm-auto" style="border: 1px solid #630000; color: #630000; background: transparent;">
